Madison County","/arc-plc/mississippi/madison-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Madison County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, November to December finished at 45% of normal and August to September at 60%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
